Package: heimdall-ids
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Heimdall IDS <heimdall@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10)
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: Heimdall IDS Dashboard
 A self-contained web dashboard for Suricata IDS that displays real-time
 alerts, flows, DNS, and HTTP events from eve.json.
 .
 Features: RBAC user management, webhook notifications (Slack/Discord),
 triage workflow, charts, multi-theme UI, and SSE live streaming.
 All data is stored in SQLite. No external dependencies required.
 .
 After installation, enable and start the service:
   sudo systemctl enable --now heimdall
 .
 The dashboard will be available at http://localhost:8765
 Admin credentials are printed to the journal on first start:
   sudo journalctl -u heimdall -n 30
